OL,3,GNEWSADad and daughter who dumped body
OL,4,Ain canal convicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and his daughter have been
OL,7,Fconvicted after a woman was murdered
OL,8,Fand her body was dumped in a canal.
OL,10,FChereiss Bailey was found dead near a
OL,11,Fwaterway off Ryders Green Road in West
OL,12,FBromwich in October last year.
OL,14,FJohn Anslow, 65, assaulted Bailey in
OL,15,Fhis home, before he and his daughter,
OL,16,FHayley-Marie Ferguson, 42, moved her
OL,17,Fbody in a wheelchair and used a washing
OL,18,Fline with paving slabs attached, to
OL,19,Fsubmerge it in the water, police said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
